                <div style="margin-top:2px; font-weight:700; color:#0F766E; font-size:14px;">MB Bank: <span
                    style="font-family:monospace; font-weight:800; font-size:15.5px; color:#047857; letter-spacing:0.5px;">911211688888</span>
                </div>
                <div style="font-size:11.5px; color:#64748B; margin-top:1px;">Chủ TK: <strong style="color:#1E293B;">TT
                    CUNG UNG DVC PHUONG DONG HUNG THUAN TP HCM</strong></div>
                <div style="font-size:11.5px; color:#64748B;">Mã số thuế: <strong
                    style="color:#1E293B; font-family:monospace; font-size:12.5px;">0319444313</strong></div>
